{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Pengo &amp; Koda Demo</strong>, you play through the <strong>first world</strong> of a cooperative platform puzzle game about friendship in the Arctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117660/extras/10d16ccc9ce312ba30dbc231adfc3b1a.poster.avif?t=1762168596\" width=1164 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117660/extras/10d16ccc9ce312ba30dbc231adfc3b1a.webm?t=1762168596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117660/extras/10d16ccc9ce312ba30dbc231adfc3b1a.mp4?t=1762168596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global warming separated Koda from his family, and now Pengo must guide his friend to safety. Put together what the neglect of nature has separated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new modern cooperative platformer with a retro soul. Challenging stages filled with enigmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117660/extras/7fa47c78f01efb6137540d1302f11520.poster.avif?t=1762168596\" width=1164 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117660/extras/7fa47c78f01efb6137540d1302f11520.webm?t=1762168596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117660/extras/7fa47c78f01efb6137540d1302f11520.mp4?t=1762168596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two heroes, one goal.</strong> Pengo can <strong>swim</strong>, perform <strong>high jumps</strong>, and <strong>break ice blocks</strong>. Koda is strong and <strong>breaks specific rock blocks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Abilities:</strong> Pengo <strong>pushes stone blocks</strong> to create stairs and paths for Koda. Be careful! Koda has a <strong>short jump</strong> and <strong>cannot touch the freezing water</strong> (it restarts the stage).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essential Cooperation:</strong> Use Pengo and Koda together to break blocks, pull levers, and open doors. <strong>Iglos</strong> mark the exit, and <strong>both friends</strong> must get there. <strong>Snowmen</strong> serve as checkpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pengo &amp; Koda</strong> is an icy puzzle-focused adventure where friendship is the key to the rescue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We created this game with the hope of entertaining and highlighting the importance of friendship. We hope you enjoy playing Pengo &amp; Koda as much as we enjoyed creating it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun! :)</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4117660?t=1762168596","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4117660?t=1762168596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117660/4d53a2b603400cb084e28b8adf7b6cfa4a6b3d36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762168596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117660/4d53a2b603400cb084e28b8adf7b6cfa4a6b3d36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762168596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed