rong>break ice blocks</strong>. Koda is strong and <strong>breaks specific rock blocks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Abilities:</strong> Pengo <strong>pushes stone blocks</strong> to create stairs and paths for Koda. Be careful! Koda has a <strong>short jump</strong> and <strong>cannot touch the freezing water</strong> (it restarts the stage).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essential Cooperation:</strong> Use Pengo and Koda together to break blocks, pull levers, and open doors. <strong>Iglos</strong> mark the exit, and <strong>both friends</strong> must get there. <strong>Snowmen</strong> serve as checkpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pengo &amp; Koda</strong> is an icy puzzle-focused adventure where friendship is the key to the rescue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We created this game with the hope of entertaining and highlighting the importance of friendship. We hope you enjoy playing Pengo &amp; Koda as much as we enjoyed creating it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun! :)</strong></p>","developers":["Marcos Riffel"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4095860","name":"Pengo & Koda"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117660/b1861ef317e44883e95ce3b1367ea4f4ae73f575/header.jpg?t=1762168596","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4117660/1415223800/1776e0e323f6746992de24142eb56755033cfe04/1760652220/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762037723","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4117660/1415223800/1776e0e323f6746992de24142eb56755033cfe04/1760652220/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762037723","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4117660/1415223800/1776e0e323f6746992d